ex:spo2ReadPermission odrl:target <http://localhost:3000/alice/spo2/> .
ex:spo2ReadPermission odrl:assignee <http://localhost:3000/bob/profile/card#me> .
ex:spo2ReadPermission odrl:assigner <http://localhost:3000/alice/profile/card#me> .

